  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Destruction sphere (Admixture), Enhancement sphere.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> When using Admixture, you may spend an additional spell point to have a single creature that takes damage be targeted by an enhancement effect that you possess. If you possess the Mass Enhancement talent, you may apply the enhancement to any targets damaged, up to your maximum targets from Mass Enhancement. This ability can only target creatures, it cannot be used to affect objects.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/admixture-feats#toc8\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
